The files here were written for these tests, after the providers'
documented formats, with example addresses (RFC 5737, RFC 3849) and made-up
identifiers: a CloudTrail S3 log file, a Microsoft 365 audit log export as
the Purview portal writes it (CSV, byte order mark, AuditData), Entra ID
sign-ins and directory audits as Microsoft Graph returns them, an Azure
activity log record as diagnostic settings write it, and Entra ID sign-ins
as a Log Analytics export, and Google Workspace activities as the Admin
SDK Reports API lists them. Under this crate's licences.
